    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.8-p002",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**প্রমাণ:** মনে করি, $\\overrightarrow{OA} = <u>u</u>, \\overrightarrow{AB} = <u>v</u>$। তাহলে $\\overrightarrow{OB} = \\overrightarrow{OA} + \\overrightarrow{AB} = <u>u</u> + <u>v</u>$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\overrightarrow{OA} = <u>u</u>, \\overrightarrow{AB} = <u>v</u>",
        "\\overrightarrow{OB} = \\overrightarrow{OA} + \\overrightarrow{AB} = <u>u</u> + <u>v</u>"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 284,
      "pdfPageEnd": 284,
      "printedPageStart": 279,
      "printedPageEnd": 279,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.8-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$OA$ কে $C$ পর্যন্ত বর্ধিত করি যেন $OC = m \\cdot OA$ হয়। উপরের বামের চিত্রে $m$ ধনাত্মক ও ডানের চিত্রে $m$ ঋণাত্মক। $C$ বিন্দু দিয়ে অঙ্কিত $AB$ এর সমান্তরাল $CD$ রেখা $OB$ এর বর্ধিতাংশকে $D$ বিন্দুতে ছেদ করে। যেহেতু $OAB$ এবং $OCD$ ত্রিভুজদ্বয় সদৃশ,",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "OA",
        "C",
        "OC = m \\cdot OA",
        "m",
        "m",
        "C",
        "AB",
        "CD",
        "OB",
        "D",
        "OAB",
        "OCD"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 284,
      "pdfPageEnd": 284,
      "printedPageStart": 279,
      "printedPageEnd": 279,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.8-p004",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "সেহেতু $\\frac{|\\overrightarrow{OC}|}{|\\overrightarrow{OA}|} = \\frac{|\\overrightarrow{CD}|}{|\\overrightarrow{AB}|} = \\frac{|\\overrightarrow{OD}|}{|\\overrightarrow{OB}|} = m$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{|\\overrightarrow{OC}|}{|\\overrightarrow{OA}|} = \\frac{|\\overrightarrow{CD}|}{|\\overrightarrow{AB}|} = \\frac{|\\overrightarrow{OD}|}{|\\overrightarrow{OB}|} = m"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 284,
      "pdfPageEnd": 284,
      "printedPageStart": 279,
      "printedPageEnd": 279,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.8-p005",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore OC = m \\cdot OA, CD = m \\cdot AB, OD = m \\cdot OB$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore OC = m \\cdot OA, CD = m \\cdot AB, OD = m \\cdot OB"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 284,
      "pdfPageEnd": 284,
      "printedPageStart": 279,
      "printedPageEnd": 279,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.8-p006",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore \\overrightarrow{CD} = m\\overrightarrow{AB} = m<u>v</u>$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore \\overrightarrow{CD} = m\\overrightarrow{AB} = m<u>v</u>"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 284,
      "pdfPageEnd": 284,
      "printedPageStart": 279,
      "printedPageEnd": 279,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.8-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "এখানে, $\\overrightarrow{OC} + \\overrightarrow{CD} = \\overrightarrow{OD}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\overrightarrow{OC} + \\overrightarrow{CD} = \\overrightarrow{OD}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 284,
      "pdfPageEnd": 284,
      "printedPageStart": 279,
